# Payment Portal — Docker build context excludes.
# Packaging hygiene (FFM-ABM-001 E2): keep docs, credentials, browser state and
# local build/test output out of any image build context.
# CRITICAL: .env* keeps local secrets out of the image. Next.js standalone output copies .env files
# into .next/standalone — without these lines .env.local would ship in the final image.
agent_docs/
_SKILLS/
.env*
.auth/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
e2e/
node_modules
.next
.git
# Merged 2026-11-03 by next-deploy-auto v1.3 (Template 1b lines not already present).
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
cloudbuild.yaml
deploy.sh
init-app.sh
upload-secrets.sh
stark-deploy.yaml
DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md
README.md
# Added 2026-11-21 (alpha; carried over from the OwedBook alpha review, cyph-v1-dev 2026-11-20).
# The former "!.env.example" exception is removed: no .env* file of any name enters the context.
# `.env*` above covers the context root only; these cover every depth.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*service*account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/.auth/
# Case variants of credential file names (OwedBook canary test 2026-11-20: serviceAccount.json got through).
**/*[sS][eE][rR][vV][iI][cC][eE]*[aA][cC][cC][oO][uU][nN][tT]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
**/*[cC][rR][eE][dD][eE][nN][tT][iI][aA][lL][sS]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
**/*.[pP][eE][mM]
**/*.[pP]12
**/*.[kK][eE][yY]
# Factory records and local tooling that are not build inputs.
RECOVERY.md
CHANGELOG.md
WINDSURF.md
CLAUDE.md
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
